msgstr "WREN  999990"

#: story/egg_props.gd:346
msgid "INSERT COIN"
msgstr "コインを入れてね"

#: story/egg_props.gd:349
msgid "SWEEP-O-TRON"
msgstr "スイープ・オ・トロン"

#: story/egg_props.gd:441
msgid "BISCUIT"
msgstr "ビスケット"

#: story/egg_props.gd:469
msgid "FIZZ"
msgstr "FIZZ"

#: story/egg_props.gd:615
msgid "(it is not wet)"
msgstr "（濡れてないよ）"

#: story/egg_props.gd:632
msgid ""
"THE LEDGER IS WATCHING\n"
"(FOR SAVINGS)"
msgstr ""
"LEDGER が見ています\n"
"（節約のために）"

#: story/egg_props.gd:710
msgid ""
"EMPLOYEE OF\n"
"THE MONTH\n"
"— CUBE —"
msgstr ""
"今月の\n"
"優秀社員\n"
"— キューブ —"

#: story/egg_props.gd:740
msgid ""
"FORECAST\n"
"ALWAYS RIGHT*"
msgstr ""
"天気予報\n"
"いつも的中*"

#: story/egg_props.gd:765
msgid "SHOW ENTRY"
msgstr "ショー入口"

#: story/egg_props.gd:807
msgid "THE BUILDERS · DO NOT TIDY"
msgstr "ビルダーズ · 片づけ禁止"

#: story/egg_props.gd:895
msgid "FINE"
msgstr "罰金"

#: story/egg_props.gd:972
msgid ""
"BACK IN\n"
"5 MINUTES"
msgstr ""
"5分で\n"
"戻ります"

#: story/eggs.gd:448
msgid "Something metal surfaced in the cleared ground."
msgstr "片づいた地面から何か金属のものが出てきた。"

#: story/eggs.gd:663 story/eggs.gd:725
msgid "Gnome %d / %d"
msgstr "ノーム %d / %d"

#: story/eggs.gd:671
msgid "The last poster points somewhere close. Something orange is curled up nearby."
msgstr "最後のポスターがすぐ近くを指している。近くでオレンジ色の何かが丸まっている。"

#: story/eggs.gd:726
msgid "%s   ·   added to Lumi's collection"
msgstr "%s   ·   Lumiのコレクションに追加"

#: story/eggs.gd:742
msgid "The radio hisses quietly. Nothing up there is awake yet. Come back after dark."
msgstr "ラジオが小さくザーッと鳴っている。上ではまだ何も目覚めていない。暗くなってからまた来よう。"

#: story/eggs.gd:743
msgid "Through the telescope: just a bright, dusty sky. Come back after dark."
msgstr "望遠鏡をのぞくと：明るくほこりっぽい空だけ。暗くなってからまた来よう。"

#: story/eggs.gd:772
msgid "SOLD OUT"
msgstr "売り切れ"

#: story/eggs.gd:790
msgid "QUACK!"
msgstr "グワッ！"

#: story/eggs.gd:808
msgid "NEW CHALLENGER!"
msgstr "新たな挑戦者！"

#: story/eggs.gd:811
msgid "GAME OVER  ·  SCORE 12"
msgstr "ゲームオーバー  ·  スコア 12"

#: story/eggs.gd:839
msgid "hi, Gus"
msgstr "やあ、ガス"

#: story/eggs.gd:884
msgid "CONFETTI"
msgstr "紙吹雪"

#: story/eggs.gd:884
msgid "LIGHT JAZZ"
msgstr "ライトジャズ"

#: story/eggs.gd:884
msgid "99% DUCKS"
msgstr "アヒル率 99%"

#: story/eggs.gd:884
msgid "SUNNY (INDOORS)"
msgstr "晴れ（屋内）"

#: story/eggs.gd:884
msgid "FOG OF NOODLES"
msgstr "ヌードルの霧"

#: story/eggs.gd:889
msgid "1ST PLACE"
msgstr "1位"

#: story/eggs.gd:947
msgid "The duck squeaks a secret: \"%s\" unlocks the %s design."
msgstr "アヒルがキュッと秘密をささやく：「%s」で %s デザインが解放される。"

#: story/eggs.gd:948
msgid "The duck has taught you everything it knows. Quack."
msgstr "アヒルは知っていることを全部教えてくれた。グワッ。"

#: story/eggs.gd:1179
msgid "Curiosity found: %s  (%d / %d)   %s"
msgstr "珍品発見：%s（%d / %d）   %s"

#: story/eggs.gd:1190
msgid "Every curiosity on the list, found. Lumi's collection compartment is very full of memories."
msgstr "リストの珍品をぜんぶ見つけた。Lumi のコレクション室は思い出でいっぱい。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:9
msgid "Wait. Hold it up to the light."
msgstr "待って。光にかざしてみて。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:10
msgid "That's a Settler seed tin. Cradle stamp on the lid. One of ours, left behind in the rush."
msgstr "それ、入植者の種の缶だ。ふたに Cradle号のスタンプ。私たちのものだよ。急いでいて置いていかれたんだ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:11
msgid "When they left, the Settlers sealed every seed they could carry into the Cradle's vault. Your vault, Lumi."
msgstr "去るとき、入植者たちは運べるかぎりの種を Cradle号の保管庫に封じた。君の保管庫だよ、Lumi。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:12
msgid "The plan was simple. Wait for the dust to settle. Come home. Plant. They called that day the Greenfall."
msgstr "計画は簡単だった。ちりが落ち着くのを待つ。帰る。植える。その日を彼らは Greenfall と呼んだ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:13
msgid "Then three hundred years went by, and the dust never settled. Until a seed-keeper fell out of the sky."
msgstr "そして三百年が過ぎ、ちりは落ち着かなかった。シードキーパーが空から落ちてくるまでは。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:14
msgid "Nothing grows on its own anymore. The soil forgot how. Somebody has to put it in the ground."
msgstr "もう何もひとりでは育たない。土が育て方を忘れたんだ。誰かが土に植えてあげないと。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:15
msgid "That somebody is you. Small. Stubborn. Running on four percent. Perfect."
msgstr "その誰かが君。小さくて。がんこで。残り4パーセントで動いてる。完璧だ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:16
msgid "Find clean ground. Dig. Drop it in. Pat it down. And then — this part matters — water it."
msgstr "きれいな地面を探して。掘って。入れて。土をぽんぽん。それから——ここが大事——水をあげて。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:143
msgid "{tool_water}  then hold  {scoop}  to water it"
msgstr "{tool_water}  のあと  {scoop}  長押しで水やり"

#: story/first_seed.gd:169
msgid "Hold  {scoop}  on clean ground to plant the seed"
msgstr "きれいな地面で  {scoop}  長押しで種を植える"

#: story/first_seed.gd:246
msgid "...It's green. Lumi, it's actually green."
msgstr "……緑だ。Lumi、ほんとうに緑だよ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:248
msgid "Keep it watered. Seeds are rare out here, but every bloom gives one back, and a little green light for your core. This is how it starts."
msgstr "水を切らさないでね。ここでは種は貴重だけど、花が咲くたびにひとつ返ってくるし、きみのコアにも小さな緑の光が届く。こうやって始まるんだ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:361
msgid "Lumi, that green signal is back, stronger now. Follow the beam: the old greenhouse."
msgstr "Lumi、あの緑のシグナルがまた来た。前より強い。光の柱を追って。古い温室だよ。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:370
msgid "Lumi. I'm getting a signal. Green, faint, east of the hub. An old greenhouse. Go look."
msgstr "Lumi。シグナルを受信。緑で、かすかで、基地の東。古い温室だ。見てきて。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:18
msgid "Clear of the air. Look back, {name}. Look at it."
msgstr "大気を抜けた。振り返って、{name}。見て。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:19
msgid "Five worlds, green. The Ledger left them as rubbish. You left them as gardens."
msgstr "5つの世界が緑。Ledger はゴミとして捨てていった。あなたは庭として残していく。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:20
msgid "CRADLE:  SYSTEM SURVEY: FIVE WORLDS.  FIVE ALIVE."
msgstr "CRADLE：星系調査：5つの世界。5つとも生存。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:21
msgid "CRADLE:  CHARTER CONDITION MET.  WAKING SLEEPERS.  OPENING BAY ONE."
msgstr "CRADLE：憲章の条件を満たした。眠る者たちを起こす。第1格納庫を開放。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:22
msgid "It's opening the bay. It's actually opening the bay. Steady... steady..."
msgstr "格納庫を開けてる。本当に開けてる。落ち着いて……落ち着いて……"

#: story/homecoming.gd:25
msgid "The vault. Your vault. It looks exactly like you left it."
msgstr "保管庫。あなたの保管庫。出ていったときのまま。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:26
msgid "You climbed into a cargo pod to save that tray. Three hundred years later, you brought it home."
msgstr "あのトレイを守るために、あなたは貨物ポッドに乗り込んだ。300年後、ちゃんと持って帰ってきた。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:27
msgid "Hear that? Below decks. Doors. Voices. They're waking up, {name}."
msgstr "聞こえる？　下のデッキ。扉の音。声。みんな目を覚ましてる、{name}。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:28
msgid "The first thing they'll see is a world that's green again. You did that. Small. Stubborn. Perfect."
msgstr "彼らが最初に見るのは、また緑になった世界。あなたがやったのよ。小さくて、頑固で、完璧。"

#: story/homecoming.gd:132 data/achievements.json:achievements[home_homecoming].name data/codex.json:homeward.homecoming.name
#: data/radio.json:songs[homecoming].name
msgid "Homecoming"
msgstr "帰郷"

#: story/intro.gd:239
msgid "Three hundred years ago, the last seeds left Verdance aboard the ark Cradle."
msgstr "三百年前、最後の種はアーク Cradle号に乗って Verdance を去った。"

#: story/intro.gd:240
msgid "Lumi, the ark's little seed-keeper, sang to the seedlings every night."
msgstr "アークの小さなシードキーパー Lumi は、毎晩苗たちに歌を歌っていた。"

#: story/intro.gd:241
msgid "Humming again, Lumi? They can't hear you, you know. ...They do grow faster when you do."
msgstr "また鼻歌かい、Lumi？聞こえてないんだよ。……でも、君が歌うと育つのが速いんだよね。"

#: story/intro.gd:242
msgid "Then, one night, the sky came apart."
msgstr "そして、ある夜、空が裂けた。"

#: story/intro.gd:243
msgid "Hull breach in the vault bay! Lumi, leave the trays, get clear!"
msgstr "保管庫ベイで船体破損！Lumi、トレイはいいから、離れて！"

#: story/intro.gd:244
msgid "Lumi— hold on— I can't turn her around— hold on—"
msgstr "Lumi——がんばって——向きを変えられない——がんばって——"

#: story/intro.gd:245
msgid "The ark could not turn back. The pod fell for days."
msgstr "アークは引き返せなかった。ポッドは何日も落ち続けた。"

