#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].kind
msgid "log"
msgstr "記録"

#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].title
msgid "Maintenance log, unit P-46RA"
msgstr "整備記録、ユニット P-46RA"

#: data/shards.json:shards[maint_log].body
msgid ""
"DAY 4,113\n"
"Route 12 complete. 41 bales.\n"
"Ledger notice received: \"Operations paused pending cost review.\"\n"
"Returning to dock.\n"
"\n"
"DAY 4,114\n"
"Still paused.\n"
"\n"
"DAY 4,190\n"
"Still paused. Dock battery 31%.\n"
"There is a flower growing through the gutter at route 12, marker 9.\n"
"Nobody is cleaning around it. I hope that's all right."
msgstr ""
"4,113日目\n"
"ルート12完了。ベール41個。\n"
"Ledger より通知受信：「コスト審査中につき作業停止」\n"
"ドックへ帰還。\n"
"\n"
"4,114日目\n"
"まだ停止中。\n"
"\n"
"4,190日目\n"
"まだ停止中。ドックのバッテリー31%。\n"
"ルート12、標識9の側溝から花が一輪咲いている。\n"
"そのまわりを誰も片づけない。それでいいのだと思いたい。"

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].kind
msgid "memo"
msgstr "社内連絡"

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].title
msgid "Memo, Municipal Ledger Office"
msgstr "社内連絡、市 Ledger 局"

#: data/shards.json:shards[ledger_memo].body
msgid ""
"TO: All Sanitation Units\n"
"FROM: THE LEDGER (Automated Fiscal Continuity)\n"
"RE: Pause of Operations\n"
"\n"
"Cleanup activity is presently valued at a net loss of 0.4 units per bale.\n"
"All units will pause operations until conditions improve.\n"
"Conditions will be reviewed every 24 hours.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your understanding.\n"
"This memo was generated automatically. Please do not reply."
msgstr ""
"宛先：全清掃ユニット\n"
"差出人：THE LEDGER（自動財政継続システム）\n"
"件名：作業停止について\n"
"\n"
"清掃作業は現在、ベール1個あたり 0.4 単位の純損失と評価されています。\n"
"全ユニットは状況が改善するまで作業を停止してください。\n"
"状況は24時間ごとに見直されます。\n"
"\n"
"ご理解のほどよろしくお願いいたします。\n"
"本連絡は自動生成されています。返信しないでください。"

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].kind
msgid "voicemail"
msgstr "留守番電話"

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].title
msgid "Voicemail transcript"
msgstr "留守番電話の書き起こし"

#: data/shards.json:shards[voicemail].body
msgid ""
"\"Hi, it's Dad. The shuttle's tomorrow at six. They said one bag each, so... pick your favorite stuffed animal, not all of them, okay? And... we're leaving the cleanup bots running. They'll keep it tidy for when we come back. It won't be long. Love you. Bye.\"\n"
"\n"
"[Message saved]"
msgstr ""
"「もしもし、パパだよ。シャトルは明日の6時。ひとり一つのかばんだって言われたから……いちばん好きなぬいぐるみを選んでね、全部はだめだよ、いいね？ それと……清掃ロボットは動かしたままにしていくよ。戻るまできれいにしておいてくれる。そんなに長くはかからないさ。愛してる。じゃあね」\n"
"\n"
"[メッセージを保存しました]"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].kind
msgid "poster"
msgstr "ポスター"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].title
msgid "Faded safety poster"
msgstr "色あせた安全ポスター"

#: data/shards.json:shards[poster].body
msgid ""
"THE CRADLE IS WATCHING OVER US\n"
"\n"
"Every seed. Every spore. Every egg.\n"
"Safe in orbit until the Greenfall.\n"
"\n"
"KEEP YOUR STREETS CLEAN — THE ROBOTS CAN'T DO IT ALONE\n"
"\n"
"(Someone has scratched underneath: \"they can if you let them\")"
msgstr ""
"CRADLE号が見守っています\n"
"\n"
"すべての種。すべての胞子。すべての卵。\n"
"Greenfall の日まで軌道上で安全に。\n"
"\n"
"街をきれいに — ロボットだけではできません\n"
"\n"
"（誰かが下にひっかいて書いている：「任せてくれればできる」）"

